#### 🔴 P0 — 修复后端 verifyAccessToken

当前 `auth-service.ts` 的 `verifyAccessToken` 丢掉了 `impersonatorId`：

```ts
// 现在：只返回 userId 和 role
return { userId: payload.userId, role: payload.role };

// 需要：保留 impersonatorId
return {
  userId: payload.userId,
  role: payload.role,
  impersonatorId: payload.impersonatorId,
