### Phase 1 — 计费逻辑对齐（后端）

1. **让 `processCommission()` 像 `renewal` 一样统一规则**：先查 `commission_rules.sale`，没有再降级到 `agents.commissionRate`

```typescript
// billing.ts — 修改 processCommission 函数
async function processCommission(...) {
  // 查询客户归属及代理商
  const [client] = await tx... from agentClients ... innerJoin agents

  // NEW: 查 sale 规则
  const [rule] = await tx
    .select({ rate, maxCap })
    .from(commissionRules)
    .where(and(
      eq(commissionRules.agentId, client.agentId),
      eq(commissionRules.ruleType, 'sale'),
      eq(commissionRules.isEnabled, true),
      ...
    ))
    .limit(1);

  let rate: number;
  let maxCap: number | null = null;
  if (rule) {
    rate = Number(rule.rate);
    maxCap = rule.maxCap ? Number(rule.maxCap) : null;
  } else {
