### 三、后端改动

#### 3.1 计费引擎对齐 (`src/services/billing.ts`)

**`processCommission()` — sale 佣金**：改为统一查 `commission_rules`，**不再依赖 `agents.commissionRate`**

```typescript
async function processCommission(tx: any, userId: number, callLogId: number, callCost: string) {
  // 1. 查用户归属的代理商
  const [client] = await tx
    .select({ agentId: agentClients.agentId })
    .from(agentClients)
    .where(eq(agentClients.clientUserId, userId))
    .limit(1);
  if (!client) return;

  // 2. 查 sale 规则（无降级，只读 commission_rules）
  const [rule] = await tx
    .select({ rate: commissionRules.rate, maxCap: commissionRules.maxCap })
    .from(commissionRules)
    .where(and(
      eq(commissionRules.agentId, client.agentId),
      eq(commissionRules.ruleType, 'sale'),
      eq(commissionRules.isEnabled, true),
    ))
    .limit(1);
  if (!rule || Number(rule.rate) <= 0) return;

const rate = Number(rule.rate);
  let commissionAmount = Number(callCost) * rate;
  if (rule.maxCap) commissionAmount = Math.min(commissionAmount, Number(rule.maxCap));

  // 3. 写入 commission_logs + agent_customer_consumption + processTeamCommission
  // ...（其余不变）
}
```

> 同理 `processRenewalCommission()` 去掉对 `agents.commissionRate` 的降级逻辑，只读 `commission_rules.renewal`。

